# Large binary data (see DATA_NOT_IN_GIT.md)
# GitHub rejects files >100 MB and warns above 50 MB. Git cannot ignore by size,
# so the three >50 MB files are all *.h5ad and are covered by this pattern.
*.h5ad
*.zip
